      "source": [
        "# 🎬 AI Subtitle Generator & Refiner - Colab Setup\n",
        "\n",
        "## Prerequisites\n",
        "1. **Enable GPU** → Runtime > Change runtime type > Select **GPU** (T4 recommended)\n",
        "2. **Run cells in order** (top to bottom) - do not skip any cell\n",
        "3. **Wait for the Streamlit link** to generate before clicking\n",
        "4. **Click the public URL** to open the web app\n",
        "\n",
        "## App Features\n",
        "- **AI Transcription** - Uses faster-whisper for accurate speech-to-text\n",
        "- **Roman Hindi/Punjabi** - Automatic transliteration support\n",
        "- **Karaoke Highlights** - Word-level highlighting effect\n",
        "- **6 Subtitle Styles**: Romanised, Original, Styled, Karaoke, Bilingual, Lip Sync\n",
        "- **Custom Fonts** - Upload your own .ttf, .otf, .ttc files\n",
        "- **Full Styling** - Colors, borders, shadows, fonts, positioning\n",
        "\n",
        "## How to Use\n",
        "1. Upload a video file (MOV, MP4, MKV)\n",
        "2. Click **Step 1: Generate Subtitles** - wait for transcription\n",
        "3. Edit text in **Step 2** if needed (do not change timestamps)\n",
        "4. Select subtitle style in **Step 3** and click **Create Final Video**\n",
        "5. Download the final video or SRT file\n",
        "\n",
        "⚠️ **IF ERROR OCCURS** → Runtime > Restart runtime and run all cells again"
      ]
    },
